# Lab artifacts. results/ IS committed: VLearn Codelabs muc 3.1 quy dinh bai nop la
# mot URL GitHub/HuggingFace "ben trong phai co results/ + submission/REPORT.md".
# Repo goc bo qua results/ vi no gia dinh nop bang ZIP; o day ignore no dong nghia
# voi nop mot repo rong.
# adapters/ KHONG len GitHub. Muc 6.1 khuyen nghi kem adapters/correct/, nhung
# adapter_model.safetensors cua run nay nang 123,9 MB (32.464.896 tham so x 4 byte,
# fp32) -- vuot tran 100 MB/file cua GitHub. Git LFS cung khong dung duoc: GitHub tu
# choi upload LFS object len mot public fork ("can not upload new objects to public
# fork"). Muc 6.2 cho phep dung cach nay: de adapter ngoai, ghi ro trong REPORT/LINKS.
